gQ7(){return"Yes. At an uncontrolled intersection of equal significance, give way to cars on the right (clause 13.11)."},
gQa(){return"Is it possible to overtake at an equivalent intersection without a traffic light?"},
gQ9(){return"No. At an uncontrolled intersection, overtaking is allowed only when driving on the main road (clause 11.4)."},
