gQb(){return"Yes. A sign warns you when approaching a roundabout."},
gQe(){return"Does the roundabout start right at this sign?"},
gQd(){return"No. This is a warning. The direction of movement on the circle itself is set by sign 4.3."},
gPF(){return"Is it possible to turn around if the road is only visible at 70 m?"},
gPE(){return"No. To turn around, visibility must be at least 100 m in each direction (clause 8.11)."},
gPH(){return"Before a dangerous turn, should you choose a safe speed?"},
gPG(){return"Yes. The speed is chosen taking into account the turn and visibility of the road (clause 10.1)."},
gPP(){return"Could children suddenly come onto the road here?"},
gPO(){return"Yes. The sign warns of an area where children may appear on the road."},
