gPS(){return"Yes. If there is a contradiction between temporary and permanent signs, the temporary requirement is fulfilled."},
gPV(){return"Do you have to stop at a road works sign?"},
gPU(){return"No. The sign itself does not require stopping. You need to take roadworks into account and choose a safe speed."},
gQg(){return"Without a traffic light, do you have the right of way over a car with a second priority?"},
gQf(){return"Yes. At an uncontrolled intersection, the main road gives priority over the secondary one (clause 13.9)."},
gQi(){return"Is it possible to drive on a red light if you are on the main road?"},
gQh(){return"No. At a signalized intersection, you must follow the traffic lights (clause 6.15)."},
gQk(){return"Is it possible to park a car on the roadway of a main road outside a populated area?"},
gQj(){return"No. On such roads, parking on the roadway outside a populated area is prohibited (clause 12.5)."},
